{"title":"Dire Wolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 12 times (2.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>42</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>67</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>61</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>155</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>142</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>97</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>111</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>33</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=17\" title=\"Pick level 17\"><td><b>17</b></td><td>54</td><td>13.9</td><td>850</td><td class=\"muted\">162 · 19.5 · 2,550</td><td>42</td><td>in the wilds around -626, -480</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=18\" title=\"Pick level 18\"><td><b>18</b></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td>67</td><td>in the wilds around -313, -727</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=19\" title=\"Pick level 19\"><td><b>19</b></td><td>61</td><td>15</td><td>950</td><td class=\"muted\">183 · 21 · 2,850</td><td>61</td><td>in the wilds around -289, -760</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>155</td><td>in the wilds around -320, -744</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>142</td><td>in the wilds around 932, 40</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>97</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>111</td><td>in the wilds around 1026, -37</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>33</td><td>in the wilds around -299, -943</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dire-wolf\" data-map-level=\"20\">Show level 20 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 8 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 4 of 8 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 5 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 3 of 8 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 4 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"leather-head\" title=\"Leather Head - in 1 of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ad0df36ce44572a810c0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Leather Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-torso\" title=\"Bearhide Torso - in 1 of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ede6